Problem:
  Best time for buy and sell from the prices give prices = [7, 1, 5, 3, 6, 4]

Aproach:
  Traverse the prices array only once
  Buy for minimum price have seen so far
  And sell it for higher prices
  Track maxprofit by subtracting minprice to current day price
  And update maxprofit which get higher profit

Example:
  prices = [7, 1, 5, 3, 6, 4]
  Output:
    5

Time complexity:
  O(n) execute loop till the length prices array

Space complexity:
  O(1)
